---
config:
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 400
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: Which pages the accessibility check opens
    accDescr: A push to main and the run of each week open every page and keep a digest of the website in the cache. A pull request restores that digest. Without one, or when a stylesheet, a script, mkdocs.yml, the accepted violations or the tools differ, it opens every page, and otherwise only the pages that differ. A serious or critical violation that .github/a11y-accepted.toml doesn't accept fails the check docs.

    main["A push to main, or the run of each week"]
    pull["A pull request"]
    restore["Restores the digest of main"]
    shared{"A digest, and the same stylesheets,<br>scripts, mkdocs.yml, accepted<br>violations and tools?"}
    every["Opens every page"]
    digest["Keeps the digest for the pull requests"]
    changed["Opens only the pages that differ:<br>seconds instead of minutes"]
    gate{"A serious or critical violation that<br>.github/a11y-accepted.toml doesn't accept?"}
    fails["The check docs fails, and the PR coach<br>says what it found and how to fix it"]
    passes["The check docs passes"]

    main --> every
    every --> digest
    pull --> restore
    restore --> shared
    shared -->|no| every
    shared -->|yes| changed
    every --> gate
    changed --> gate
    gate -->|yes| fails
    gate -->|no| passes

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef person fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class restore,shared,every,digest,changed,gate bot
    class main,pull,fails person
    class passes done
